# Third-Party Licenses

This file bundles the licenses of the third-party Rust crates Tritium depends on.
It is generated by `cargo about generate about.hbs` (config: `about.toml`); do not
edit by hand. Tritium itself is licensed under **Apache-2.0** (see `LICENSE`);
vendored algorithm ports (T-MAC, BitNet, ggml, …) are attributed in `NOTICE`.

